"type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Present Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about an action that is happening or in progress at the moment. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The question form of the Present Continuous tense is as follows:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Be verb in simple present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main verb + ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you (also)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" putting ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" (What) are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talking (about)?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Are you</span> also <span class=\"strong\">putting</span> in a marble countertop?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "With my renovations, <span class=\"strong\"> things are</span> always <span class=\"strong\">stopping</span> and <span class=\"strong\">starting</span>. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">The workers are doing</span> other jobs at the same time so you never know when they will be there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'm</span> <span class=\"strong\">getting</span> fed up with these renovations.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Passive Infinitive and <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span> ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Need + passive infinitive</span> and <span class=\"strong\">need + verb + ing</span> are two structures you use to talk about fixing problems. You use these structures to imply that we don't know who will fix the problem, or that the person fixing the problem is not the focus of the sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">need</span> + passive infinitive and <span class=\"italic\">need</span> + verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span> in question form and negative form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><span class=\"underline\">need + passive infinitive</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">needs to be changed</span>!  </span>(affirmative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">doesn't need to be changed</span>. </span>(negative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Does <span class=\"strong\">this need to be changed</span>? </span>(question)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><span class=\"underline\"> need + verb + ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">This place <span class=\"strong\">needs painting</span>.</span> (affirmative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">This place <span class=\"strong\">doesn't need painting</span>. </span>(negative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Does</span> this place <span class=\"strong\">need painting</span>? </span>(question)", "type": "text"}, {"content": " It also <span class=\"strong\">needs to be cleaned</span> with the right cleanser. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This <span class=\"strong\">needs to be changed</span>!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It <span class=\"strong\">needs to be taken back</span>. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This wall <span class=\"strong\">needs removing</span>. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The place <span class=\"strong\">needs painting</span> and the countertop <span class=\"strong\">needs to be sealed and installed</span>. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Does</span> anything else <span class=\"strong\">need fixing</span>?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "contractor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person or firm that undertakes a contract to provide a service or do a job", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The contractor said they were nearly finished.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when you renovate your house.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "marble", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a hard crystalline metamorphic form of limestone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you also putting in a marble countertop?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "countertop", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a level surface on a cabinet or display case, usually used in a kitchen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you also putting  a marble countertop in the kitchen?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sealer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a substance applied to a porous surface", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You know it needs to be treated with a protective sealer, right?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "aesthetics", "type": "name"}, {"content": "things related to beauty ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  They combine aesthetics and functionality.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "functionality", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ability to function as intended", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They combine aesthetics and functionality.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "open-concept", "type": "name"}, {"content": "(in a house or office) having few or no internal walls or partitions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wanted more of an open-concept area.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "estimated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "calculated approximately", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wonder what the estimated day of completion is.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to annoy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to disturb or bother; to irritate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That really annoys me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to show up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to appear ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Nobody showed up to work on my place!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob10aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you need to have your house cleaned professionally.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue of a phone conversation between the cleaning service and you. (Use <span class=\"italic\">need to</span>+passive infinitive or <span class=\"italic\">need</span>+verb+ing)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Identify at least three things that need to be done in the house. Include the cleaning service price.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue with someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about what needs to be done in my house.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write three things that need to be done in the house.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the dialogue with someone about having your house cleaned.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's just go in and see what needs to be done. The contractor said they were nearly finished.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Wow. Are you also putting in a marble countertop?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You know it needs to be treated with a protective sealer, right?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't worry, I know about that. It also needs to be cleaned with the right cleanser.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: These faucets are beautiful!"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "21000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Yes. They combine aesthetics and functionality. Also they won't drip! Oh-oh. This needs to be changed!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What are you talking about?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The dishwasher. It needs to be taken back. It's too small for the space. I also asked them to open up the wall more. This wall needs removing. I wanted more of an open-concept area. Gosh, I wonder what the estimated day of completion is. I'm getting fed up with these renovations.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, the floors, island and most of the drywall have been installed.  The place needs painting and the countertop needs to be sealed and installed. That wall can be taken down without too many issues. I think you should estimate one week."}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "67600", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: One week! With my renovations, things are always stopping and starting. The workers are doing other jobs at the same time so you never know when they will be there. Once, four days went by and nobody showed up to work on my place!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That really annoys me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Does anything else need fixing?"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about household problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about things that need to be done. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about things that I'm doing and things that are happening.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How much time do you spend in your kitchen?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Would you like to remodel your kitchen? If so, how?", 